            "review_title": "Review at Bagel Brothers - District 2",
            "review_text": "Nathan S\n2 contributions\n0\nExcellent Bagels in the heart of Ho Chi Minh City.\nJun 2023 • Family\nOur family from Australia (travelling with young children) visited Bagel Brothers for lunch. We were very impressed by the high quality and wide selection of delicious bagels and foccacias. Their glazed donuts are the best I've eaten in Vietnam, light and fluffy. Excellent coffee (Melbourne-style lattes) and cold drinks, especially the house brewed non-alcoholic ginger beer. The new shop is cool, clean, light and spacious with a space for the kids that has a gaming console. Excellent customer service. Conveniently located near the main markets and shopping. Definitely recommend for families and those looking for tasty Western food options. Large groups can easily be catered for in the upstairs area which also features a balcony overlooking the playground. Five stars!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 18, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
