            "review_text": "davoslingo\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nBEST BAGEL IN HCMC\nJul 2023 • Solo\nI must say, this place knows how to craft a truly scrumptious bagel! Upon taking my first bite, I couldn't resist devouring it in just 5 minutes - that's how irresistibly delicious it was! The bagel had the perfect combination of flavors, and the texture was spot on, creating a delightful taste experience.\n\nFrom the moment I walked in, the welcoming ambiance and friendly staff made the visit even more enjoyable. The bagel was freshly prepared and served warm, which only enhanced the delectable experience.\n\nWhether you're a bagel enthusiast or just looking for a delightful treat, this place is a must-visit! The craving to indulge in another one lingers on even after the last bite. Don't miss the chance to savor their scrumptious bagels; it's a culinary delight that you won't regret!\n\nHighly recommended, and I can't wait to return for another delightful bagel experience!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 7, 2023",
