            "review_title": "Review at Bagel Brothers - District 2",
            "review_text": "Alyshia\nToronto, Canada366 contributions\n1\nBest bagels in Saigon!\nApr 2020 • Solo\nBagel Brothers is by far the best place to grab a bagel in Saigon. Hands down. And believe me when i say I’ve done my fair share of bagel tasting in this city! \n\nAside from just the bagels, their sandwiches are also super tasty! The Chicken Avocado Bagel is one of my absolute faves. I order it at least once a week, it’s that good! 😍\n\nBagels are a true Canadian staple. So naturally I was on the hunt for Saigon’s finest when I moved over here! Thankfully Bagel Brothers exists so I can get my weekly fill! 🥯\nRead more\nWritten April 16, 2020",
